                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Health care is too expensive, and we must continue working to lower premiums and health care costs for American families. Today\u2019s vote is a good step to lower health care costs and require long-overdue transparency from pharmacy benefit managers. I\u2019ll continue working on bipartisan solutions that protect consumer choice, bring down the cost of prescriptions as well as premiums, and improve access to care. Thank you @RepMMM for leading these efforts!",
